===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ML.|en}} {{term|characterizare}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|χαρακτηρίζω||to designate by a characteristic mark|tr=kharaktērizō|lang=grc}}, from {{term|χαρακτήρ||a mark, character|tr=kharaktēr|lang=grc}}. Synchronically analyzable as {{suffix|character|ize}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|/ˈkɛɹəktəɹaɪz/|/ˈkæɹəktəɹaɪz/|lang=en}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈkæɹəktəɹaɪz/|lang=en}}
* {{hyphenation|char|ac|ter|ize}}

